            "description": "Same-day void of an AUTHORISED sale — must be sent before batch close. Routes through the connected terminal (appears in device transaction history).\n\nUse **Remote Reversal** (in the Back-Office folder) to reverse without the terminal being actively connected.\n\n**originalTransactionId** — the `transactionID` from the AUTHORISED sale result (saved from the `last_transaction_id` collection variable).\n\nCommon error: code `3051` means the transaction was already reversed."
          },
          "response": []
