            },
            "description": "Manually trigger end-of-day batch settlement.\n\nAfter batch close, same-day reversals are no longer possible — use a Refund instead.\n\nEPI/TSYS only. Not applicable to EmerchantPay or Paystrax (those acquirers settle automatically)."
          },
          "response": []
